This is a placeholder for the sample Excel template file.

To create a proper Excel template, please create an Excel file with the following columns:

REQUIRED COLUMNS:
Column A: SKU (required) - Unique product identifier
Column C: Name (required) - Product name

STANDARD COLUMNS:
Column B: Parent SKU - Leave empty for main products, fill for variants
Column D: Description - Product description
Column E: Short Description - Short product description
Column F: Price - Product price
Column G: Regular Price - Regular price (for sale products)
Column H: Sale Price - Sale price
Column I: Stock - Stock quantity
Column J: Stock Status - Stock status (instock, outofstock, onbackorder)
Column K: Category - Product category (comma-separated for multiple)
Column L: Image URL - Google Drive image link
Column M: Gallery Images - Comma-separated Google Drive image links
Column N: Status - Product status (publish, draft, private)
Column O: Featured - Featured product (yes/no)
Column P: Virtual - Virtual product (yes/no)
Column Q: Downloadable - Downloadable product (yes/no)
Column R: Weight - Product weight
Column S: Length - Product length
Column T: Width - Product width
Column U: Height - Product height
Column V: Purchase Note - Purchase note
Column W: Menu Order - Menu order
Column X: Reviews Allowed - Allow reviews (yes/no)
Column Y: Sold Individually - Sold individually (yes/no)
Column Z: Backorders - Backorders (no, notify, yes)
Column AA: Tax Status - Tax status (taxable, shipping, none)
Column AB: Tax Class - Tax class
Column AC: Catalog Visibility - Catalog visibility (visible, catalog, search, hidden)

ADDITIONAL COLUMNS:
Any additional columns will be treated as ACF (Advanced Custom Fields) if the ACF plugin is active.

Example data using the centralized column mapping system:
SKU,Parent SKU,Name,Description,Price,Regular Price,Stock,Category,Image URL,Gallery Images,Status
PROD001,,Sample Product,This is a sample product,100,120,50,Electronics,https://drive.google.com/file/d/123456/view,https://drive.google.com/file/d/789012/view,publish
PROD001-VAR1,PROD001,Red Variant,Red color variant,110,130,25,Electronics,https://drive.google.com/file/d/345678/view,,publish
PROD001-VAR2,PROD001,Blue Variant,Blue color variant,110,130,25,Electronics,https://drive.google.com/file/d/901234/view,,publish

The plugin uses a centralized column mapping system where:
- Column names are defined in one place (column-mappings.php)
- All functions use the same mapping functions
- Easy to modify column names globally
- Consistent handling across the entire plugin 